Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:05:52.78,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:05:52.78,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 莱巴金娜 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh yeah, I think overall the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,总体来说 这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,算是成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, uh today was uh pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 今天挺可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't have uh much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有太多能量了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh tried my best, but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽力了 但还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:15.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh anyway, I tried to take only positive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我尽量只把好的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:18.36,EN,,0,0,0,,from this tournament to uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,从这一站带走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:21.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for the next ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,留给接下来的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Elena, sorry about the loss today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 今天输球很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You kind of touched upon it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚才提到了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Just how much was the effect
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,想问影响到底有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of like the three-set matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些三盘大战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and your hours on court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你在场上的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and just consecutively leading into tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场接一场 一直到今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it was uh um big uh uh how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得影响很大 呃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was just very tired
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh you could see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,that I wasn't pushing with the legs enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的腿蹬不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh a lot of uh unforced errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.68,EN,,0,0,0,,especially on top of the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是网前那些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It was just pure lack of concentration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,纯粹是注意力不够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and even on these uh kind of easy balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,连那些简单球都是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, and uh uh of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:02.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, she's uh a tough opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,伊加是很难打的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh she was uh trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,她一直在想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to get all the balls back uh of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,把每一个球都救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, it was uh difficult for me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以今天对我来说很难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:12.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I just hope that I take all the lessons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我希望能把这些教训都记住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh somehow next time I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望下次我能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:20.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,做得更好一些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you feel coming
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年温网之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.52,EN,,0,0,0,,into Toronto this year after Wimbledon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到多伦多时你感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you feel like a big result like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时有没有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,this was something that was coming
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样一个好成绩就要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,your way uh the way that your game
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and your practice was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,和训练的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I was not uh thinking too much how
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有想太多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the tournament overall will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一站整体会怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:40.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I was just uh uh trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to bring everything we worked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,把我们之前练的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.28,EN,,0,0,0,,on for a couple of weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,那几周的功课
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:45.32,EN,,0,0,0,,before coming here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:45.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,全都带到场上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:48.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh um I think we did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们做得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So, slowly, match by match,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场一场慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I could see the the results,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能看到结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.72,EN,,0,0,0,,some improvement, and I'm just happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到一些进步 我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,the way it all went despite the loss today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽管今天输了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:01.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh um yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:02.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the important right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:02.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得现在最要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,is just to forget uh this tournament already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,是赶紧把这一站忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and try to to prepare for the next one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,去准备下一站
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully uh do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望能打得一样好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,甚至更好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Elena, great tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 这一站打得很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh I was just wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.32,EN,,0,0,0,,you obviously the fatigue was a big factor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,疲劳显然是个很大的因素
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,but it seemed like a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但比赛里有几次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.52,EN,,0,0,0,,of times during the match you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,看起来你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.72,EN,,0,0,0,,were like stretching out your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在拉伸自己的手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if that was anything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,想问是不是有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.04,EN,,0,0,0,,if anything was bothering you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,那里是不是不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:27.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I I'm not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不太确定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:31.12,EN,,0,0,0,,if I can tell you what is not hurting actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,能不能告诉你 哪儿是不疼的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:34.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh so, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of destroyed of course now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在感觉整个人都散了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh especially
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,when the tournament is finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛一打完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,uh you feel kind of everything even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都感觉得更清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:48.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh um I think that this time I actually
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我觉得这次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.36,EN,,0,0,0,,did better with a scheduling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在赛程安排上做得好一些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:53.32,EN,,0,0,0,,because uh I was playing a lot of matches
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我有不少比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in the morning during the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,排在早上和白天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:57.08,EN,,0,0,0,,then uh at night, and I think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后是晚上 我想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:03:02.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that uh this is also um big uh big difference
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:03:02.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是很大的区别
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and this time compare maybe other
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟别的一些赛事比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,tournaments I did a bit better,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这次我做得好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,but uh it was just uh very pity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还是很可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that uh I didn't have enough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有足够的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to push this last match even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,在最后这场再往前推一把
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi there. What made Iga
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 今晚是什么让伊加
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:20.68,EN,,0,0,0,,a tough opponent tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:20.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为这么难缠的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:27.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, um she's uh playing really well uh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,她防守打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:31.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in defense and then she can uh take
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后她能抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the opportunity during the the rally
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,回合中的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and turn it around and uh as I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,把局面反过来 我刚才也说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,for me I feel like it was more from my side
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得更多是我自己的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:45.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that I wasn't playing aggressive enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得不够主动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,was not with the energy enough to play
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,也没有足够的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.56,EN,,0,0,0,,against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,去跟她打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,And we all know she's a fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都知道她很能拼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and she can run left
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,她能左右奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:59.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and right much longer than me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,跑得比我久得多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and we have different style of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们的打法不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't show my style at my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我没能打出最好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I tried really till the end and uh I think Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的拼到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,just first set starting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是第一盘开局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.08,EN,,0,0,0,,with two double faults losing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个双误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:20.44,EN,,0,0,0,,this game also As I said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,就丢掉了那一局 我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:22.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in the previous press conference,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,在上一次发布会上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,you can't always be chasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你不能总是在追赶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:29.64,EN,,0,0,0,,You need sometimes to actually start up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候得由你先起势
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.16,EN,,0,0,0,,during the matches and for now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,在比赛里 而到目前为止
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:34.28,EN,,0,0,0,,it's been always for me chasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直都在追赶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so this time I couldn't turn it around,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这次我没能反过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:38.76,EN,,0,0,0,,couldn't bring this extra energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿不出那份额外的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:41.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but uh definitely I think Iga played
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:41.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得伊加确实
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,her game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出了她的球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:45.88,EN,,0,0,0,,She uh she was fresh and she played better
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,她更有体力 也打得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in some important moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一些关键分上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.80,EN,,0,0,0,,The gap in the rankings between you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和萨巴伦卡之间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:52.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and Aryna Sabalenka
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,排名的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is really quite close right now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在其实已经很近了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:55.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and I know you've mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that you don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你平时并不怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.44,EN,,0,0,0,,about it much day-to-day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,去想这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but when you were a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.96,EN,,0,0,0,,when you were growing up, did you dream
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,长大的过程中 有没有梦想过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,of being the number one player
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world and what would that mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果真做到了 那对你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to you if you are able to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh well, it would mean definitely a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,那当然意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh I know for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:15.32,EN,,0,0,0,,even if you say by the ranking it's close,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算你说排名上已经很近
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.76,EN,,0,0,0,,for me it still feels very far
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说还是很远
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,since I'm not thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:23.64,EN,,0,0,0,,so much and we all still compete,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,太去想它 我们都还在比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,so it doesn't depend only
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这不只取决于
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:28.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on me also uh how others are going
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一个人 还要看别人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to do, but uh when I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得怎么样 而我小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I was not even if we talk about kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果说小孩子那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I was not even thinking that I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我甚至没想过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:38.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to be professional playing at this level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己能打到职业的这个级别
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:41.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I think I achieved quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我已经拿到很多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm super happy and if I can do better,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我非常开心 如果能做得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:45.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I try my best
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully it it it happens one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望有一天能实现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:52.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
